  "details": "It would be ideal with a new tools section to add a auto reporting option to the VCC packages used in the Uploaded World scene & Uploaded Avatar Descriptor. While a large portion of the community do know the tooling created for worlds and avatars. More niche systems and tools slide under the rug even if they are great.\n\nNot only will this mean new creators can learn what tools are commonly used, it also means that packages will be more visible and attribution can be consistent.\n\nWhile this may not work for all packages/ assets with unity, it would still be better than nothing!",
